    "description": "C28 heading"
  },
  "accountLegalPrivacyBody": "We keep your name, phone number, photo and saved addresses to run your bookings. A provider sees your exact address and phone number only after accepting your booking. We use your location only when you ask us to find it. We never sell your data.",
